   "text": "▶ Play"
  },
  {
   "tag": "output",
   "id": "eq-time-value",
   "text": "0.00"
  },
  {
   "tag": "button",
   "id": "eq-connect",
   "text": "Connect points"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "id": "eq-x-name",
   "text": "X · annulus"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "id": "eq-y-name",
   "text": "Y · filled disk"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "id": "eq-source-title",
   "text": "y · t = 0"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "id": "eq-now-title",
   "text": "Homotopy Hₜ(y)"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "id": "eq-compose-title",
   "text": "f(g(y)) · t = 1"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "id": "eq-copy-title",
   "text": "g(y) · copy"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "id": "eq-note",
   "text": "Both maps exist. The disk round trip works, but the annulus round trip is obstructed by its hole."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "id": null,
   "text": "Same color = same original input. Follow the solid lines around the loop. The dashed lines track the homotopy from the top row to the bottom row."
  },
  {
   "tag": "button",
   "id": "eq-clear",
   "text": "Clear circle"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "id": "eq-selection",
   "text": "The circled point keeps the color of its original input."
  },
  {
   "tag": "summary",
   "id": null,
   "text": "Why? / The two maps"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "id": null,
   "text": "f includes the annulus in the filled disk. g sends the disk to p = (0.75,0) in the annulus."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "id": null,
   "text": "Both compositions are constant. On the disk, (1−t)x + tp gives a homotopy from the identity to the constant composition. On the annulus this attempt enters the hole, and winding rules out every alternative. More generally, a space homotopy equivalent to a disk would be contractible; the annulus is not."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "id": null,
   "text": "The top and bottom X pictures show exactly the same intermediate output. The homotopy is in Y: at t = 0 it matches the original input above, and at t = 1 it matches the composition below. The homotopy need not be one-to-one."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "id": null,
   "text": "Background: Hatcher, homotopy equivalence."
  },
  {
   "tag": "a",
   "id": null,
   "text": "Background: Hatcher, homotopy equivalence."
  }
